  "teleporter/30006-4.htm": {
   "file": "teleporter/30006-4.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Roxxy: Since the time of the Elmoreden Empire, the Ivory Tower has been the center of mystical research for all Aden. If you should have occasion to visit it, please give my regards to my former mentor, Grand Magister Valleria.",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Roxxy",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Back",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 0",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "teleporter/30006.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "teleporter/30006-5.htm": {
   "file": "teleporter/30006-5.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Roxxy: The Airship Field is where Airships heading to and from Gracia dock. A powerful magic force field prevents entry to Gracia from sea or via teleportation. But Gracian-made Airships can travel safely through the force field. It is still a dangerous journey, though! After several yea…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Roxxy",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Teleport to Gludio Airship Field.",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_goto 12120",
     "kind": "teleport"
    },
    {
     "text": "Back",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Chat 0",
     "kind": "page",
     "to": "teleporter/30006.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "teleporter/30006-pk.htm": {
   "file": "teleporter/30006-pk.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Roxxy: I'm sorry, but the Ivory Tower, to which I am assigned, forbids giving magical help to someone like you. Sorry, but you must reflect on yourself and repent some more before coming back.",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Roxxy",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
