  "Q00001_LettersOfLove/30006-01.html": {
   "file": "Q00001_LettersOfLove/30006-01.html",
   "quest": 1,
   "text": "Roxxy: A letter...for me? From Darin? What does it say, I wonder... Oh my, I had no idea he had these feelings for me. I wish he hadn't waited so long to tell me! Please give Darin my handkerchief as a pledge of my affection for him. And tell him...tell him not to waste any more time. Tell him to c…",
   "header": "Roxxy",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1; has items 687; lacks items 688"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00001_LettersOfLove/30006-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00001_LettersOfLove/30006-02.html",
   "quest": 1,
   "text": "Roxxy: You haven't given my handkerchief to Darin yet? He must be suffering terribly waiting for my answer. Please put his mind at ease. Hurry to him and tell him that I have feelings for him as well.",
   "header": "Roxxy",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 2; has items 688"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00001_LettersOfLove/30006-03.html": {
   "file": "Q00001_LettersOfLove/30006-03.html",
   "quest": 1,
   "text": "Roxxy: Did you give Darin my handkerchief? What did he say? Oh... I thought he would rush over and ask permission to court me, but instead... Sometimes he acts just like a shy little boy! Although I have to confess that that's a large part of why I find him so attractive. I think he brings out the …",
   "header": "Roxxy",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 3; (hasQuestItems(player, DARINS_RECEIPT) || hasQuestItems(player, BAULROS_POTION))",
    "state STARTED; cond 4; has items 1080"
