  "Q00006_StepIntoTheFuture/30006-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00006_StepIntoTheFuture/30006-03.htm",
   "quest": 6,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Roxxy: Oh, I hope I didn't give you the wrong impression! Traveling to Giran from here is very, very expensive! I doubt you could afford it... But perhaps there is another way. Speak with Magister Baulro at the Temple of Einhasad. He's always happy to meet students from Talking Island; i…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Roxxy",
   "sets": {
