   "file": "Q00006_StepIntoTheFuture/30006-06.html",
   "quest": 6,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Roxxy: How wonderful for you! Both Baulro and Sir Colin are such helpful people that I'm not surprised. Here is a special Scroll of Escape capable of opening a Dimensional Door to Giran. Pay close attention: it can only be used once! Use it like any other Scroll of Escape. Here as well i…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Roxxy",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
   "links": []
  },
